{
    "method": "engineeringAnalytics.prLifecycle",
    "toolName": "pr-lifecycle",
    "operationId": "engineering_analytics_pr_lifecycle",
    "title": "PR lifecycle timeline",
    "category": "Engineering analytics",
    "description": "The timeline of a single pull request: a header (number, title, author, state, draft, timestamps) plus ordered events: opened, ready for review, converted to draft, CI started, CI finished, and merged or closed. Use this to answer \"where is this PR stuck and what happened to it\". Draft/ready transitions appear only when the issue-events table is synced and cover a bounded recent window. metric_quality is \"partial\": review and comment events are not yet available. For aggregate questions use the pull-requests and workflow-health tools.",
